 id="wireless-c62" value="CAPWAP over PtP1 → S01-WLC" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#7AC4BE;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fontSize=9;fontColor=#0D9488;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingRight=8;spacingBottom=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="wireless-L2"><mxGeometry x="990" y="506" width="310" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wireless-c63" value="&lt;b&gt;IT WLAN&lt;/b&gt; · SSIDs CORP (802.1X → VLAN 130), WH-SCAN (802.1X → VLAN 131, warehouse APs) and GUEST (→ VLAN 190, VRF GUEST, internet only) · APs in local mode, CAPWAP to S01-WLC (W01) · AP switchports: access VLAN 135, 802.1X/MAB · mGig ports for Wi-Fi 6E APs (802.3bt). Warehouse APs ride PtP1 to the core; the ProCurve is PoE+ only — check the AP power table." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="wireless-L5"><mxGeometry x="90" y="486" width="770" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wireless-c64" value="&lt;b&gt;S01-FW-ITOT · PA-450 HA&lt;/b&gt; — no CAPWAP, SSID, RADIUS or controller management crosses IT ⇄ OT (DW1). OT wireless is self-contained below this line." style="shape=label;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=5;spacingLeft=28;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;points=[[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0]];fontFamily=Inter;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageWidth=22;imageHeight=22;imageAlign=left;imageVerticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="wireless-L4"><mxGeometry x="90" y="616" width="1220" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wireless-c65" value="S01-OT-WLC · C9800-L HA 