EAP-TLS against the OT AD / NPS (F22).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;C02-AGV&lt;/b&gt; → CELL02 only, FlexConnect local switching on AP-C02-01 so AGV traffic stays in the cell and survives a controller outage.&lt;br&gt;• Industrial APs (IW9167EH) with external antennas; fixed 5 GHz channels, no DFS on AGV aisles.&lt;br&gt;• Managed only from OT jump hosts (W05 = F18)." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#F6FBF8;strokeColor=#E2F1E7;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="wireless-L5"><mxGeometry x="720" y="800" width="590" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wireless-c86" value="CELL02 · Line 2 — Packaging &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;font-weight:normal;color:#64748B&quot;&gt;AGV workgroup bridges · FlexConnect&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=24;fillColor=#F8F5FE;strokeColor=#D1BAF9;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7C3AED;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="wireless-L2"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1050" width="700" height="274" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wireless-c87" value="CELL03 ext. · Pump house &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;font-weight:normal;color:#64748B&quot;&gt;PtP2 backhaul — not WLAN&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=24;fillColor=#F8F5FE;strokeColor=#D1BAF9;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7C3AED;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="wireless-L2"><mxGeometry x="820" y="1050" width="490" height="274" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wireless-c88" value="&lt;b&gt;S01-C02-IE02&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#64748B&quot;&gt;IE-3400-8T2S · REP 12&lt;/span&gt;" style="sh